                                        <div class="stack_area _6e2724bf">
                        <section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-mtykm nsdrs-y4oab nscrs-jivtd" data-id="9851e4eb-fd0c-4b87-b1dd-4de8d3a97a18"><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container _5d5af514 column-container--has-more-settings"><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--fd176bd4 _1100af70--fd176bd4 _b45e4f82 nclrs-sakm0" data-column="1" id="column_1_stack_62353" data-unique-id="nclrs-sakm0"><div class="block nblrs-f8emk picture_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="2145061" data-uuid="999e2882-2c2a-4db1-b6ab-e471f14428fd" data-block="nblrs-f8emk" data-block-type="image" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><span class="picture_block_holder"><div id="picture-2145061" class="picture picture-2145061 position-center hover-none shape-square filter-none align-right sync-overlay sync-border" ><div class="picture_block_holder__spacer"></div><div class="picture-border"  style="box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #1b1b1b"></div><div class="picture-overlay"  style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)"></div><div class="picture-hover-overlay" ></div><picture>  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=5;3;0;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=481,height=227,sharpen=1.00/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=5;3;0;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=481,height=227,dpr=2,sharpen=0.80/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg 2x" media="(min-width: 1460px)">  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=6;3;0;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=403,height=190,sharpen=1.00/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=6;3;0;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=403,height=190,dpr=2,sharpen=0.86/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg 2x" media="(min-width: 1080px) AND (max-width: 1460px)">  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=303,height=143,sharpen=1.00/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=303,height=143,dpr=2,sharpen=0.95/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg 2x" media="(min-width: 740px) AND (max-width: 1080px)">  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=500,height=236,sharpen=0.99/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=500,height=236,dpr=2,sharpen=0.78/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 740px)">  <source data-srcset="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=324,height=153,sharpen=1.00/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg, https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=0;0;3;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=324,height=153,dpr=2,sharpen=0.93/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg 2x" media="(max-width: 400px)">  <img data-src="https://pictures.rs-cdn.com/CF-a126d914-249f-45bf-9940-bdafcdfdfc02/trim=6;3;0;0,fit=cover,gravity=auto,width=403,height=190,sharpen=1.00/327e79e6fee312ce0e995c87830e3a1a.jpg"  data-block-id="2145061" alt="" class="partial-width-image lazy-load"></picture></div></span></div></div></div><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--b32fa6f8 _1100af70--b32fa6f8 _b45e4f82 nclrs-2ukf5" data-column="2" id="column_2_stack_62353" data-unique-id="nclrs-2ukf5"><div class="block nblrs-q7sgd text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="193567" data-uuid="999e036b-e79d-4f01-9f01-b6de623025bc" data-block="nblrs-q7sgd" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container"><div class="heading-container"><h2 class="heading"><strong>Looking for a heat pump supplier in Wellington, Upper Hutt or Lower Hutt? Look no further than BA Heat Pumps!</strong></h2></div>    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all text-padding">        <p class="p-font"><strong>B A Heat Pumps Electrical Division Ltd is a team of electricians with over 25 years of experience in the trade industry.</strong></p><p class="p-font"><strong>We pride ourselves on professional, trustworthy service, whose passion translates to a positive outcome with our customers.</strong></p><p class="p-font"><strong>We're more than just another air-conditioning and heat pump supply and installation company. We're experienced electricians, ready to handle a range of electrical tasks, whether it's rewiring existing homes, connecting kitchen ovens, carrying out CCTV and </strong><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/page/cctv"><strong>alarm system</strong></a><strong> installation or installing </strong><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/rewiring-houses"><strong>new residential electrical</strong></a><strong> wiring . We've got your home and business electrical needs covered. We're here to ensure your property is comfortable, secure, and energy-efficient.</strong></p><p class="p-font"><strong><br></strong><a target="_self" rel="noopener" type="page" href="/contact-us"><strong>Contact us </strong></a><strong>today to find out more about our heat pump and other electrical service deals.</strong></p><p class="p-font">We are an Air-conditioning &amp; heat pump Wellington company that is quite diverse in its services. As electricians, we can offer all electrical services from residential to commercial. Whether it is wiring new or old houses to your basic just wiring up an oven all the way through to CCTV &amp; security alarm systems &amp; solar.</p><p class="p-font">We care about every install and if the job's not right, <strong>we will quickly ensure it's done correctly</strong>. So relax and trust that your job will not only be within budget but also be carried out with the highest standard of workmanship and on time. It is no wonder that we are one of the best heat pump companies in Wellington.</p><p class="p-font"><strong>A little about us</strong></p><p class="p-font">We work across the greater Wellington region, including the Hutt Valley, Porirua and the Kapiti Coast. For larger jobs, we can travel nationwide, including Auckland, Gisborne, and Christchurch.</p>    </div></div></div><div class="block nblrs-oo2dx h1_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="2149751" data-uuid="999e2888-8083-4c41-9bdc-ac30a8fcbecb" data-block="nblrs-oo2dx" data-block-type="h1" data-content-revision="1"><div class="h1-block-container block_content_container">    <h1 class="heading typekit-element ">Team</h1></div></div><div class="block nblrs-8snq1 text_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="2149771" data-uuid="999e2888-89c0-492a-b840-f37bc2827a97" data-block="nblrs-8snq1" data-block-type="text" data-content-revision="1"><div class="block_content_container">    <div class="text_block_text p-font p-font-all">        <p class="p-font"><strong>We are registered electricians, Fujitsu &amp; Gree accredited installers, Licensed refrigerant handlers, St Johns first aid qualified, Site safe passport approved. Not here to wow you with our qualifications...&nbsp;</strong></p><p class="p-font">Our team can suggest the best heat pump solution for your need. They can help you plan your next central heating solution. This will allow heating and cooling of all rooms from one central location with help of ducts or you can just go with a multi-unit heat pump&nbsp;for your NZ home. The indoor units for multi-unit are usually controlled independently and the outdoor heat pump unit is responsible for either absorb or dispense heat or your can simply go with a single unit.</p><p class="p-font">We have specialized in residential and commercial heat pumps installs all over NZ.</p>    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="stack _bf4e9d50 stack--content-width-default stack--vertical-top stack--mobile-vertical-top custom-stack design-editable-stack content-editable-stack nstrs-w692w nsdrs-q3pk3 nscrs-8etec" data-id="9851e96f-d288-4c81-8fb6-510bece809c6"><div class="stack-inner _dbf617b7"><div class="column-container _5d5af514 column-container--has-more-settings"><div class="column _1100af70 _4993ced5 _4993ced5--9f806a06 _1100af70--9f806a06 _b45e4f82 nclrs-d3shq" data-column="1" id="column_1_stack_788259" data-unique-id="nclrs-d3shq"><div class="block nblrs-ule5b h1_block _6d30e4c5" data-id="2154020" data-uuid="999e288c-e78d-416e-9983-c3091b782633" data-block="nblrs-ule5b" data-block-type="h1" data-content-revision="1"><div class="h1-block-container block_content_container">    <h1 class="heading typekit-element  align-center">Get FREE quote</h1></div></div><div class="block nblrs-4jpdq form-builder-block _6d30e4c5" data-id="2140615" data-uuid="999e287c-abea-45de-b819-82f7f6e31981" data-block="nblrs-4jpdq" data-block-type="form" data-content-revision="1"><div class="form-builder-container block_content_container gtm-form-tracking" :class="{'form-builder-container--form-submitted': formSubmitted}" v-cloak><form    class="form-builder _3f7c9771--a80eb9c4"    name="rs-aec3-6ac0-6de9"    data-form-name="Free Quotes"    data-vv-scope="rs-aec3-6ac0-6de9"    data-nonce="a2c6cdb1-b2a1-40e7-ab06-6a88547fbb30"    v-on:submit.prevent    novalidate        ><div class="rs-form-builder_row rs-form--name" :class="{'error': errors.has('rs-aec3-6b21-a44e', 'rs-aec3-6ac0-6de9')}"><label for="rs-aec3-6b21-a44e">Name</label><input type="text" data-type="text" name="rs-aec3-6b21-a44e" id="rs-aec3-6b21-a44e" class="rs-form-builder--basic rs-field rs-field--input" data-name="Name" v-validate="'required'" :class="{'error': errors.has('rs-aec3-6b21-a44e', 'rs-aec3-6ac0-6de9')}" data-vv-as="Name" v-model="formF